The existing RIASEC rules must remain unchanged.

Preserve the established implementation:

- 48 assessment items.
- 8 items per RIASEC domain.
- Response scale: 1–5.
- Domain sum: 8–40.
- Domain percentage: ((sum - 8) / 32) × 100.
